    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rooney Auctioneers are delighted to present this fantastic, must see, beautifully designed and decorated 4 bedroom detached property. The location could not be better with a host of excellent amenities including the University of Limerick, Castletroy College, Castletroy Shopping Centre,and is within easy distance to numerous national & secondary schools, Lisnagry National School, Castletroy College It is also within easy access to all major motorways.\r\nThis turn key property has a electric gated entrance driveway. This spacious home comprises of an entrance hallway, large front living room with stove fitted, large open plan kitchen-diner with a modern custom made fitted kitchen with quartz worktops and porcelain tiled splashback, kitchen island with downdraft Nikola Tesla gas hob, Bosch integrated dishwasher, fridge and Bosch oven and microwave, two sliding doors off to rear garden; utility room, main bathroom - fully tiled porcelain bathroom having bath and wet room Shower, 2 bedrooms downstairs: bedroom 1 with solid oak wood floor, bedroom 2 with tiled floor, wardrobe. Upstairs: 2 bedrooms both having en-suites, the main bedroom has a walk in wardrobe, en-suite having electric shower, tiled; bedroom 4, with en-suite bathroom, heated towel rack. Balcony area overlooking the rear garden, OUTSIDE: Large private gardens not overlooked to the front or rear with patio area and large garage fully wired, Steeltech shed, outside taps hot and cold, sockets and sensor lighting, electric gated entrance. This is an ideal family home in a location second to none. Homes in the locality of this type rarely come to market. Viewing A Must. Offers in excess of €535,000\r\nContact Peter Kearney at Rooney's 061-413511."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway: 5.68m x 1.99m With porcelain tiles.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 5.30m x 4.60m With wood flooring, stove fitted.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room: 8.41m x 3.49m Fully fitted kitchen, custom made fitted kitchen with quartz worktops, patio doors.\r\n\r\nUtility: 3.21m x 1.36m tiled floor, washing machine, dryer. fitted units\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 4.14m x 3.18m, solid oak floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 3.30m x 4.13m With tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom: 3.11x x 2.08m Newly tiled, bath, wet room\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 4.62m x 3.57m, en-suite, electric shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: 4.18m x 5.42m LWF, en-suite, electric shower"
      },
      {
